## 🚀 Part 8: Submission Process

### Step 1: Choose Your Venue
- **Workshop**: NeurIPS AI in Finance (deadline: ~May)
- **Conference**: AAAI, IJCAI (deadline: ~August)
- **arXiv**: Anytime (do this FIRST!)

### Step 2: Format Check
- Follow the venue's template exactly
- Check page limits (usually 6-8 pages for conferences)
- Ensure all figures are high resolution (300 DPI)

### Step 3: Submit to arXiv First
1. Go to [arxiv.org](https://arxiv.org)
2. Create account
3. Upload your PDF
4. Choose category: "Quantitative Finance" or "Machine Learning"
5. Submit!

### Step 4: Submit to Conference
1. Go to conference submission portal
2. Upload PDF
3. Fill out metadata (title, abstract, keywords)
4. Submit before deadline!

